Comment: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:27.78,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k300}潛入敵後
Comment: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:34.20,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k630}繼承的羈絆  斬斷一切
Comment: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:35.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k71}一齊
Comment: 0,0:01:35.53,0:01:38.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k292}那孩子是誰  只有她自知
Comment: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:41.25,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k271}大鬧一場吧  盡情鬧吧
Comment: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:43.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k222}不只是可愛哦
Comment: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:47.30,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k352}今日颯爽登場
